---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Configuration — Cortex">
  <h1>Configuration</h1>

  <h2>Settings</h2>
  <p>Cortex reads its configuration from <code>config.json</code> in your workspace root.</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Setting</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>agent</code></td><td><code>"build"</code></td><td>Default agent mode: <code>plan</code>, <code>build</code>, or <code>ask</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>opencodeBinary</code></td><td><code>"opencode"</code></td><td>Path to the OpenCode binary</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>opencodePort</code></td><td><code>4096</code></td><td>Port for the OpenCode server</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Providers</h2>
  <p>Cortex connects to AI providers through OpenCode. Supported providers:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>OpenAI</strong> — GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, o3, etc.</li>
    <li><strong>Anthropic</strong> — Claude Sonnet 4, Opus 4, etc.</li>
    <li><strong>Google</strong> — Gemini 2.5 Pro, Flash, etc.</li>
    <li><strong>xAI</strong> — Grok models</li>
    <li><strong>OpenRouter</strong> — 200+ models via proxy</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Context Sources</h2>
  <p>Cortex automatically gathers context from:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Active file</strong> — the file you're editing</li>
    <li><strong>Selection</strong> — highlighted text</li>
    <li><strong>Lexical search</strong> — keyword matching across the project</li>
    <li><strong>Semantic search</strong> — MiniLM embeddings for related code</li>
    <li><strong>Rules</strong> — <code>.cortex/rules</code> files</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 { margin-top: 3rem; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  ul { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  code {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  th, td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  th { color: var(--text); font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  td { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
</style>
